roll-Engine/PayrollEngine/releases\"><strong>Releases</strong></a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Payroll-Engine/PayrollEngine/discussions\"><strong>Discussions</strong></a> </p> > **This repository** contains the Docker stack, payroll examples, automated tests, JSON schemas, and release artifacts. > **Full documentation** — concepts, guides, and API reference — is available at [payrollengine.org](https://payrollengine.org). --- ## What is the",
